#
# The C++ components (espos_n2k, espos_voice, espos_audio, espos_usb_storage)
# are written in Google style -- 2-space indent, `Type* p`, 80 columns --
# unlike the C components, which keep the 4-space IDF look of the root
# .clang-format. The same file sits in each so the style cannot drift between
# them.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
# Include order is deliberate: the component's own header first, then the
# espOS headers it depends on, then the system and IDF ones. Google's
# regrouping would move e.g. "espos_health.h" below <cerrno>; never reorder.
SortIncludes: Never
